==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Akita Prefecture'''.
*Akita Prefecture's base is a reference to [[wikipedia:Kiritanpo|kiritanpo]], an Akita delicacy consisting of skewered cylindrical half-smashed rice toasted over an open flame.

